{"author":{"id":"2462ded6f56967dde059994c39a506c79e39e5dfd10c5a07f07a23a5652a8353"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1775218678,"nonce":"eCboOHPbIcpkfQiF84o8SMJTjwc=","title":"Support different agent kinds for coder and review steps, and skip overflow for review sessions.","message":"Currently overflow mode applies to ALL container launches — including review sessions. When overflow is ON with `agent_kind: openhands`, review containers also get overflow env vars, which breaks Claude Code review (it tries to use the alternate provider).\n\nThe desired workflow: OpenHands does development (cheap), Claude Code reviews (expensive/accurate).\n\n\nREVIEW.md already has its own `agent.kind: claude-code` — review containers read REVIEW.md via `--workflow REVIEW.md` and `load_workflow()` creates the right agent. The only missing piece: `launch.py` must skip overflow for review sessions.\n\n- tests/test_overflow.py::test_overflow_skipped_for_review_step\n  Assert: when step=\"review\", `overflow` kwarg passed to `run_container` is None even when flag file exists\n- tests/test_overflow.py::test_overflow_applied_for_coder_step\n  Assert: when step=\"coder\", `overflow` kwarg is the OverflowConfig (existing test, verify it passes)\n- tests/test_launch.py::test_review_launch_ignores_overflow\n  Assert: review launch with overflow flag present does not inject overflow env vars\n\n- host/launch.py (modify — wrap overflow check with `if not names[\"is_review\"]`)\n- tests/test_overflow.py (modify — add review skip test)\n- tests/test_launch.py (modify — add review overflow test)\n\n1. In `host/launch.py`, wrap the overflow flag check (lines 117-127) with `if not names[\"is_review\"]:`\n2. Add test that launches with `--step review` and verifies overflow is None\n3. Add test that launches with `--step coder` and verifies overflow is set\n\nSee existing `test_launch_passes_overflow_when_flag_present` in tests/test_overflow.py.\n\nREQ: REQ-028 (multi-provider support)","files":null}]}